                <h2>7. How to refuse or withdraw</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>iOS:</strong> Settings &gt; Privacy &amp; Security &gt; Tracking — turn tracking off for the App (or turn off "Allow Apps to Request to Track").</li>
                    <li><strong>Android:</strong> Settings &gt; Google &gt; Ads &gt; Delete advertising ID (on older Android versions: "Opt out of Ads Personalization"). Menu names may vary by device.</li>
                    <li><strong>In the App:</strong> Settings &gt; Privacy choices (shown where Google's consent tools apply) — change or withdraw consent, or opt out of sale or sharing.</li>
                    <li><strong>Pro:</strong> buying Pro removes ads.</li>
                    <li><strong>Notifications:</strong> turn off the reminder in the App's Settings or in your device's settings.</li>
                    <li><strong>Stop all collection:</strong> uninstall the App.</li>
                </ul>

